  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.27 Recommendations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.27 \"Recommendations\" means written advice of legally constituted authorities as to the use of pesticides within the scope of Section 2(ee) of the Federal Insecticide, Fungicide and Rodenticide Act, amended (1978-PL95-396) which might appear in the most current form of extension bulletins or publications, research data, crop guides or other media.\n\nSource. #2666, eff 4-3-84; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6239, eff 5-2-96",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes100.html"
